Prairie Giraffe – Uptime Monitoring + Backup System

Cloudflare Workers + D1 + Slack + SES + R2 + Hono + React
MVP Build Spec (VibeCoder MD)

SYSTEM GOALS

Build two loosely coupled systems:

Uptime Monitoring Platform

Runs entirely on Cloudflare

Checks site availability on a schedule

Sends alerts via Slack + Amazon SES email

Stores history in Cloudflare D1

API + Dashboard UI (single Worker deployment)

Per-Site WordPress Backup System

Runs on Cloudways (DigitalOcean VPS)

Backups per site (NOT whole server)

Uploads archives to Cloudflare R2

Designed for fast restore via SFTP + DB import

Can optionally report success back to uptime system

